{"id":"6df5d33910671b21","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pra.md","title":"Gentzen Consistency of PRA","display":"thm-gentzen-consistency-pra — Gentzen Consistency of PRA","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pra","aliases":["72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pra"],"display":"thm-gentzen-consistency-pra — Gentzen Consistency of PRA","depends_on":["[[72-lem-second-incompleteness]]","[[72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency]]","[[72-df-derivability-conditions]]","[[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]]","[[72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa]]","[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §2.2.2; standard Gödel second incompleteness theorem with fixed proof coding","verification_status":"source-and-argument-reviewed","proof_status":"derived from source theorem; incompleteness proof not reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gentzen-consistency-pra — Gentzen Consistency of PRA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0869da29c285cc44\" href=\"?note=0869da29c285cc44\" title=\"72-lem-second-incompleteness\">72-lem-second-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f2af689634edc66\" href=\"?note=4f2af689634edc66\" title=\"72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency\">72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b61898f862c734c8\" href=\"?note=b61898f862c734c8\" title=\"72-df-derivability-conditions\">72-df-derivability-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6d0ec6804191d5a4\" href=\"?note=6d0ec6804191d5a4\" title=\"72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate\">72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"21edd49e38c96ce7\" href=\"?note=21edd49e38c96ce7\" title=\"72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa\">72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1c3ecb3059f70f57\" href=\"?note=1c3ecb3059f70f57\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic\">72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §2.2.2; standard Gödel second incompleteness theorem with fixed proof coding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"derived from source theorem; incompleteness proof not reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>本文件使用算术化接口的数语法模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=1\">\\(\\iota=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_2^{(1)}\">\\(\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\)</span> 检查推导的每一行均为数公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRA},\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\mathsf{PRA},\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\">\\(\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"21edd49e38c96ce7\" href=\"?note=21edd49e38c96ce7\" title=\"72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa\">72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:=\\mathsf{PRA}\\cup\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e_\\varepsilon)\">\\(U:=\\mathsf{PRA}\\cup\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e_\\varepsilon)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PA})\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PA})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PRA})\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PRA})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda,\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda,\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathsf P_1\">\\(q\\in\\mathsf P_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}\">\\(\\operatorname{Trans}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6d0ec6804191d5a4\" href=\"?note=6d0ec6804191d5a4\" title=\"72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate\">72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HBL}\">\\(\\operatorname{HBL}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b61898f862c734c8\" href=\"?note=b61898f862c734c8\" title=\"72-df-derivability-conditions\">72-df-derivability-conditions</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>一致性转移与不可证性分别使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4f2af689634edc66\" href=\"?note=4f2af689634edc66\" title=\"72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency\">72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0869da29c285cc44\" href=\"?note=0869da29c285cc44\" title=\"72-lem-second-incompleteness\">72-lem-second-incompleteness</a>。下列编码及程序的量化均为元量化；两种编码的数码不相互混用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\ \\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PRA})\\ \\exists q\\in\\mathsf P_1\\quad\\operatorname{Trans}(\\mathsf{PRA},\\mathsf{PRA},\\lambda,\\mathsf{PA},\\kappa,q)\\land\\operatorname{HBL}(\\mathsf{PRA},\\lambda).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\ \\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PRA})\\ \\exists q\\in\\mathsf P_1\\quad\\operatorname{Trans}(\\mathsf{PRA},\\mathsf{PRA},\\lambda,\\mathsf{PA},\\kappa,q)\\land\\operatorname{HBL}(\\mathsf{PRA},\\lambda).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\land\\operatorname{Trans}(\\mathsf{PRA},\\mathsf{PRA},\\lambda,\\mathsf{PA},\\kappa,q)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ U\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda(\\mathsf{PRA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\land\\operatorname{Trans}(\\mathsf{PRA},\\mathsf{PRA},\\lambda,\\mathsf{PA},\\kappa,q)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ U\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda(\\mathsf{PRA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HBL}(\\mathsf{PRA},\\lambda)\\land\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}(\\mathsf{PRA})\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{PRA}\\nvdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda(\\mathsf{PRA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HBL}(\\mathsf{PRA},\\lambda)\\land\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}(\\mathsf{PRA})\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{PRA}\\nvdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda(\\mathsf{PRA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>标准证书编码中，消去PR定义给出PRA证明到PA证明的PR变换，且PRA验证其逐行正确性；可同时选用满足HBL的PRA编码。第一式明确断言这些数据存在，而不是把不相关编码的存在性拼接起来。第二式先用Gentzen的PA一致性，再用Trans的理论内正确性；第三式由内部第二不完备性引理。</p>\n<p>原文件只有“固定有效编码”，却在Remark中才要求“标准证明谓词”；现在这些必要条件都进入前两节。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span>仍只是这里的充分归纳界，不被宣称为PRA的精确证明论序数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-lem-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"0869da29c285cc44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"4f2af689634edc66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"b61898f862c734c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-derivability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate","status":"resolved","id":"6d0ec6804191d5a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa","status":"resolved","id":"21edd49e38c96ce7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetized-proof","status":"resolved"